From ab345c29172ac2dfa6bf53022acab3e0cf57d83d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:18:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Add client-side prediction with rollback for local
 avatars

Local inputs are tagged with a sequence number; the server echoes the last applied
sequence in position events. The client rewinds to the latest authoritative state and
replays unacknowledged inputs over one measured round trip, smoothing corrections and
drawing the predicted trail on a dedicated canvas.

Also sends directionInLoop/angularVelocityBase bonus properties to clients so the
prediction can mirror the straight-angle bonus.

Co-Authored-By: Akshat Bubna <akshatb42@gmail.com>
